---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About CloudDroid" description="CloudDroid is a brand of RUNESTONE HANDLUNG s.r.o., a Czech limited liability company providing enterprise-grade cloud Android workspaces.">
  <div class="bg-slate-light py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">About CloudDroid</h1>
      <p class="text-slate text-lg">Enterprise-grade cloud Android workspaces for QA automation, app testing, and secure remote productivity.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">Company</h2>
        <p class="text-slate mb-4">CloudDroid is a brand operated by <strong>RUNESTONE HANDLUNG s.r.o.</strong>, a limited liability company registered in the Czech Republic.</p>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate">
          <p><strong>Legal name:</strong> RUNESTONE HANDLUNG s.r.o.</p>
          <p><strong>Address:</strong> Soukenická 877/9, Ostrava, 702 00, Czech Republic</p>
          <p><strong>Company ID (IČO):</strong> 23389702</p>
          <p><strong>Support:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@clouddroid.eu" class="text-navy underline">support@clouddroid.eu</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">What We Build</h2>
        <p class="text-slate mb-4">CloudDroid provides cloud-hosted Android workspaces designed for teams that need reliable, scalable, and secure environments for QA automation, mobile app testing, and remote productivity.</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-slate space-y-2">
          <li>Dedicated Android instances with consistent hardware specs</li>
          <li>Automation-friendly environments with ADB access and CI/CD integrations</li>
          <li>Session recording, audit logs, and compliance-ready controls</li>
          <li>Transparent pricing with no hidden infrastructure fees</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">Compliance & Trust</h2>
        <p class="text-slate mb-4">We operate with a compliance-first approach. Our policies, security practices, and data handling are designed to meet the expectations of enterprise customers and payment processors.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-1">Security</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate">TLS 1.3 in transit, encrypted data at rest, structured audit logging, and role-based access controls.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-1">Privacy</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate">GDPR-aligned data handling, minimal data collection, and clear retention and deletion practices.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-1">Payments</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate">Payments are processed by Dodo Payments. We do not store raw card data.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-1">Support</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate">Direct support at support@clouddroid.eu with documented response expectations.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">Legal & Policies</h2>
        <p class="text-slate mb-4">Our legal framework is designed to be clear, specific, and enforceable.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="/legal/terms" class="bg-navy text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium hover:bg-navy-light transition-colors">Terms of Service</a>
          <a href="/legal/privacy" class="bg-navy text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium hover:bg-navy-light transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>
          <a href="/legal/aup" class="bg-navy text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium hover:bg-navy-light transition-colors">Acceptable Use Policy</a>
          <a href="/legal/refund" class="bg-navy text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium hover:bg-navy-light transition-colors">Refund Policy</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
